# Headless nav check: tap each bottom tab, snapshot each screen.
# 4 tabs across 1024px → centres at x = 128, 384, 640, 896; bar centre y ≈ 777.
# Home/Explore/Profile are inline <template>s (view.show); Stats is a page welded
# into the binary from pages/stats.html (view.load). Run: tina4pascal script verify.t4s
snap /tmp/ms-1-home.png
click 384 777
snap /tmp/ms-2-explore.png
click 640 777
snap /tmp/ms-3-profile.png
click 896 777
snap /tmp/ms-4-stats.png
